      <reference href="https://www.cisecurity.org/controls/">12</reference>
      <reference href="https://www.cisecurity.org/benchmark/ubuntu_linux/">7.1.1</reference>
      <rationale xml:lang="en-US">If the <html:code>/etc/passwd</html:code> file is writable by a group-owner or the
